Note: with 10-trial tuning, the "fit" count includes inner trials. Total top-level fits 440 (with best-config refit) plus ~2400 inner trial fits. Wall clock: dominated by MLP+FTT ≈ 23 h sequential → ~1 h at 56 workers with 4 threads each (224 cores). Trees/kernel cheap.

